<p>Hi <%= @preferred_name %>,</p>

<p>We noticed you haven't connected your Slack account for <%= @event_name %> yet. Connecting your Slack lets us add you to our event channel where you'll get important updates and can chat with other attendees.</p>

<p>It only takes a few seconds:</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button "Connect your Slack account", @slack_connect_url %>
</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please reply to this email or contact us at <%= mail_to @support_email %>.</p>
